---
title: State Machine — Affiliate Payout (MF-05)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> PENDING : Admin initiates payout
  PENDING --> COMPLETED : Bank transfer reference recorded
  PENDING --> FAILED : Bank transfer failed
  FAILED --> PENDING : Admin retries payout
  PENDING --> CANCELLED : Admin cancels payout
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
